{"id":"55f71e6b97c15b04","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-second-order-arithmetic-data.md","title":"Second-order Arithmetic Syntax and Standard Truth","display":"df-second-order-arithmetic-data — Second-order Arithmetic Syntax and Standard Truth","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-second-order-arithmetic-data","aliases":["58-df-second-order-arithmetic-data"],"display":"df-second-order-arithmetic-data — Second-order Arithmetic Syntax and Standard Truth","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-second-order-arithmetic-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-second-order-arithmetic-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-second-order-arithmetic-data — Second-order Arithmetic Syntax and Standard Truth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>本文件给出原分析层级文件已指定但未提供的二阶算术编码。数变量、集合变量分别以指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span> 标识；赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\">\\(b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>数项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{nv}(i)=\\langle0,i\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{nv}(i)=\\langle0,i\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{nz}=\\langle1,\\varnothing\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{nz}=\\langle1,\\varnothing\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ns}(t)=\\langle2,t\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{ns}(t)=\\langle2,t\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{na}(t,u)=\\langle3,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{na}(t,u)=\\langle3,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{nm}(t,u)=\\langle4,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{nm}(t,u)=\\langle4,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u)=\\langle0,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u)=\\langle0,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i)=\\langle1,\\langle t,i\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i)=\\langle1,\\langle t,i\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi)=\\langle2,\\phi\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi)=\\langle2,\\phi\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi)=\\langle3,\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi)=\\langle3,\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi)=\\langle4,\\langle i,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi)=\\langle4,\\langle i,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi)=\\langle5,\\langle i,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi)=\\langle5,\\langle i,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{alls}_2(i,\\phi)=\\mathrm{not}_2(\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi)))\">\\(\\mathrm{alls}_2(i,\\phi)=\\mathrm{not}_2(\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi)))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a[i\\mapsto m]\">\\(a[i\\mapsto m]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b[i\\mapsto B]\">\\(b[i\\mapsto B]\\)</span> 是函数图删去旧的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个值后添加指定值的更新。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>有限非空集合变量块用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\omega^q\">\\(s\\in\\omega^q\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;q&lt;\\omega\">\\(0&lt;q&lt;\\omega\\)</span>）编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\vec X\\phi\">\\(\\exists\\vec X\\phi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec X\\phi\">\\(\\forall\\vec X\\phi\\)</span> 分别缩写下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(s,\\phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(s,\\phi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(s,\\phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(s,\\phi)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\equiv\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\equiv\\psi\\)</span> 在调用本文件时缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equivalent}_2(\\varphi,\\psi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Equivalent}_2(\\varphi,\\psi)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>所有函数和语法树均为集合编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(\\phi,a,b)\">\\(S(\\phi,a,b)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(\\langle\\phi,a,b\\rangle)\">\\(S(\\langle\\phi,a,b\\rangle)\\)</span>。算术运算在标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 上进行。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}\">\\(\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{arith}\">\\(\\mathrm{arith}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nT_0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{nv}(i):i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{nz}\\},\\\\\nT_{r+1}\\coloneqq T_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{ns}(t):t\\in T_r\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{na}(t,u),\\mathrm{nm}(t,u):t,u\\in T_r\\},\\qquad\nT_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}T_r,\\\\\nA_2\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u):t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i):t\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}},i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nF_0\\coloneqq A_2,\\qquad H_0\\coloneqq A_2,\\\\\nF_{r+1}\\coloneqq F_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi):\\phi\\in F_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in F_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi),\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi):i\\in\\omega,\\phi\\in F_r\\},\\\\\nH_{r+1}\\coloneqq H_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi):\\phi\\in H_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in H_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi):i\\in\\omega,\\phi\\in H_r\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}F_r,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ArithFml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}H_r.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nT_0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{nv}(i):i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{nz}\\},\\\\\nT_{r+1}\\coloneqq T_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{ns}(t):t\\in T_r\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{na}(t,u),\\mathrm{nm}(t,u):t,u\\in T_r\\},\\qquad\nT_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}T_r,\\\\\nA_2\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u):t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i):t\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}},i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nF_0\\coloneqq A_2,\\qquad H_0\\coloneqq A_2,\\\\\nF_{r+1}\\coloneqq F_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi):\\phi\\in F_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in F_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi),\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi):i\\in\\omega,\\phi\\in F_r\\},\\\\\nH_{r+1}\\coloneqq H_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi):\\phi\\in H_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in H_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi):i\\in\\omega,\\phi\\in H_r\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}F_r,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ArithFml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}H_r.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}_{58}(\\mathrm{Val})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Val}\\in\\omega^{T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\times\\omega^\\omega}\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nv}(i),a)=a(i)\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nz},a)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{ns}(t),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)+1\n\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{na}(t,u),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)+\\mathrm{Val}(u,a)\n\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nm}(t,u),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)\\mathrm{Val}(u,a)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}_{58}(\\mathrm{Val})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Val}\\in\\omega^{T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\times\\omega^\\omega}\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nv}(i),a)=a(i)\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nz},a)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{ns}(t),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)+1\n\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{na}(t,u),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)+\\mathrm{Val}(u,a)\n\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nm}(t,u),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)\\mathrm{Val}(u,a)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}_{58}(S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nS\\in2^{\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\times\\omega^\\omega\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega}\n\\land\\exists\\mathrm{Val}\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}_{58}(\\mathrm{Val})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;(S(\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Val}(t,a)=\\mathrm{Val}(u,a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(S(\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Val}(t,a)\\in b(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n(S(\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow S(\\phi,a,b)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(S(\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow S(\\phi,a,b)=1\\land S(\\psi,a,b)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(S(\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;S(\\phi,a[i\\mapsto m],b)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(S(\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\;S(\\phi,a,b[i\\mapsto B])=1)\\bigr]\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}_{58}(S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nS\\in2^{\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\times\\omega^\\omega\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega}\n\\land\\exists\\mathrm{Val}\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}_{58}(\\mathrm{Val})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;(S(\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Val}(t,a)=\\mathrm{Val}(u,a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(S(\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Val}(t,a)\\in b(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n(S(\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow S(\\phi,a,b)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(S(\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow S(\\phi,a,b)=1\\land S(\\psi,a,b)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(S(\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;S(\\phi,a[i\\mapsto m],b)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(S(\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\;S(\\phi,a,b[i\\mapsto B])=1)\\bigr]\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Equivalent}_2(\\phi,\\psi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\land\\exists S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}_{58}(S)\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\;\nS(\\phi,a,b)=S(\\psi,a,b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Equivalent}_2(\\phi,\\psi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\land\\exists S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}_{58}(S)\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\;\nS(\\phi,a,b)=S(\\psi,a,b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(\\varnothing,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(\\varnothing,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(\\langle i\\rangle^\\frown s,\\phi)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(s,\\phi)),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(\\langle i\\rangle^\\frown s,\\phi)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{alls}_2(i,\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(s,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(\\varnothing,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(\\varnothing,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(\\langle i\\rangle^\\frown s,\\phi)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(s,\\phi)),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(\\langle i\\rangle^\\frown s,\\phi)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{alls}_2(i,\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(s,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用集合大小的标准二阶算术结构给出真关系。保留原层级按标准语义等价闭包的约定；不改为纯语法前束层级。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{nv}(i)=\\langle0,i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{nz}=\\langle1,\\varnothing\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ns}(t)=\\langle2,t\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{na}(t,u)=\\langle3,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{nm}(t,u)=\\langle4,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u)=\\langle0,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i)=\\langle1,\\langle t,i\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi)=\\langle2,\\phi\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi)=\\langle3,\\langle\\phi,\\psi\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi)=\\langle4,\\langle i,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi)=\\langle5,\\langle i,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{alls}_2(i,\\phi)=\\mathrm{not}_2(\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi)))","display":false},{"tex":"a[i\\mapsto m]","display":false},{"tex":"b[i\\mapsto B]","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\omega^q","display":false},{"tex":"0<q<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\vec X\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec X\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(s,\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(s,\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\equiv\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Equivalent}_2(\\varphi,\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"S(\\phi,a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"S(\\langle\\phi,a,b\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Val}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{arith}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nT_0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{nv}(i):i\\in\\omega\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{nz}\\},\\\\\nT_{r+1}\\coloneqq T_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{ns}(t):t\\in T_r\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{na}(t,u),\\mathrm{nm}(t,u):t,u\\in T_r\\},\\qquad\nT_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}T_r,\\\\\nA_2\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u):t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i):t\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}},i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\nF_0\\coloneqq A_2,\\qquad H_0\\coloneqq A_2,\\\\\nF_{r+1}\\coloneqq F_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi):\\phi\\in F_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in F_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi),\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi):i\\in\\omega,\\phi\\in F_r\\},\\\\\nH_{r+1}\\coloneqq H_r\\cup\\{\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi):\\phi\\in H_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in H_r\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi):i\\in\\omega,\\phi\\in H_r\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}F_r,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ArithFml}_S\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r\\in\\omega}H_r.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}_{58}(\\mathrm{Val})\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Val}\\in\\omega^{T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\times\\omega^\\omega}\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nv}(i),a)=a(i)\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nz},a)=0\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{ns}(t),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)+1\n\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{na}(t,u),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)+\\mathrm{Val}(u,a)\n\\land \\mathrm{Val}(\\mathrm{nm}(t,u),a)=\\mathrm{Val}(t,a)\\mathrm{Val}(u,a)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}_{58}(S)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nS\\in2^{\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\times\\omega^\\omega\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega}\n\\land\\exists\\mathrm{Val}\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{ArithmeticTermTruth}_{58}(\\mathrm{Val})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\forall t,u\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;(S(\\mathrm{eq}_2(t,u),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Val}(t,a)=\\mathrm{Val}(u,a))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T_2\\!{}^{\\mathrm{arith}}\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;(S(\\mathrm{in}_2(t,i),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Val}(t,a)\\in b(i))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\;\\forall i\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n(S(\\mathrm{not}_2(\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow S(\\phi,a,b)=0)\\\\\n&\\land(S(\\mathrm{and}_2(\\phi,\\psi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow S(\\phi,a,b)=1\\land S(\\psi,a,b)=1)\\\\\n&\\land(S(\\mathrm{exn}_2(i,\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;S(\\phi,a[i\\mapsto m],b)=1)\\\\\n&\\land(S(\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\phi),a,b)=1\\leftrightarrow\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega\\;S(\\phi,a,b[i\\mapsto B])=1)\\bigr]\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Equivalent}_2(\\phi,\\psi)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\land\\exists S\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SecondOrderArithmeticTruth}_{58}(S)\\land\n\\forall a\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\;\nS(\\phi,a,b)=S(\\psi,a,b)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(\\varnothing,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(\\varnothing,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(\\langle i\\rangle^\\frown s,\\phi)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{exs}_2(i,\\mathrm{ExBlock}_2(s,\\phi)),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(\\langle i\\rangle^\\frown s,\\phi)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{alls}_2(i,\\mathrm{AllBlock}_2(s,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":5612,"backlinks":[{"id":"55c96a19a00b58ed","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-second-order-arithmetic-data.md|58-df-second-order-arithmetic-data]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb","f4bf86f66c1444da"]}